message: "If you use, evaluate, adapt, benchmark, or discuss SUANR_V2 in research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SUANR_V2: Uncertainty-Aware Neural Regression"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pitre"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: "2.0"
date-released: 2026-08-19
license: "LicenseRef-SUANR-V2-Research-Evaluation-1.0"
abstract: >-
  SUANR_V2 is an experimental uncertainty-aware neural regression system
  combining ensemble-based regression, uncertainty estimation, calibration,
  prediction intervals, and empirical validation across multiple regression
  datasets and test conditions.
keywords:
  - uncertainty-aware machine learning
  - neural regression
  - prediction intervals
  - uncertainty estimation
  - calibration
  - ensemble learning
  - regression
